# AllRatesToday API key (optional).
#
# Without a key the app runs in ECB demo mode: official European Central Bank
# daily reference rates, ~30 currencies, updated each business day.
#
# With a key you get real-time mid-market rates for 160+ currencies.
# Grab a free key (no credit card) at https://allratestoday.com/register
#
# ALLRATES_API_KEY=art_live_your_key_here
